OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785176311
OL,3,CFour arrested after dramatic car chase
OL,4,Cthrough village
OL,6,FCheshire Police released video of the
OL,7,Fcar chase in Church Lawton
OL,9,FPolice have released dramatic footage
OL,10,Fof officers chasing a car thorugh a
OL,11,Fvillage in Cheshire.
OL,13,FThe incident unfolded at lunchtime on
OL,14,FSunday 26 July, when police
OL,15,Fintercepted a beige Citroen C3 near
OL,16,FAlsager following reports the car was
OL,17,Flinked to a number of burglaries in
OL,18,Fneighbouring Staffordshire.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
