PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785176311
OL,3,CFour arrested after dramatic car chase
OL,4,Cthrough village
OL,6,FThe car failed to stop and was then
OL,7,Fdriven off at speed. Additional
OL,8,Fofficers were called to the scene, and
OL,9,Fa stinger was used to bring the
OL,10,Fvehicle to a stop on Liverpool Road
OL,11,FEast in the village of Church Lawton.
OL,13,FAt one point, with a police car trying
OL,14,Fto force the car to stop, one of the
OL,15,Fcar's occupants is seen trying to get
OL,16,Fout of the passenger-side window as
OL,17,Fthe vehicle is still moving.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785176311
OL,3,CFour arrested after dramatic car chase
OL,4,Cthrough village
OL,6,FOne man inside the car was arrested at
OL,7,Fthe scene,. Three other people fled on
OL,8,Ffoot but were caught soon afterwards
OL,9,Fafter a police helicopter and police
OL,10,Fdog were deployed.
OL,12,FA 24-old man from Crewe and an 18-year-
OL,13,Fold from Stoke were detained for
OL,14,Fquestioning while the two teenagers,
OL,15,Faged 16 and 17 and from Stoke, were
OL,16,Fbailed pending further inquiries.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
