OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785176311
OL,3,CFour arrested after dramatic car chase
OL,4,Cthrough village
OL,6,FInspector Deborah Morgan, Force
OL,7,FIncident Manager at Cheshire Police
OL,8,Fsaid: "This was a real team effort,
OL,9,Fand all those who attended played key
OL,10,Froles in helping to arrest the four
OL,11,Fsuspects, including the police dog who
OL,12,Fhelped track down the fourth suspect.
OL,14,F"Burglary is a deeply personal crime
OL,15,Fandcan leave victims feeling unsafe
OL,16,Fand insecure in their own homes and
OL,17,Fhere at Cheshire Police, we're
OL,18,Fcommitted to doing all we can to
OL,19,Ftackle the issue.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
